Chapter: Hud Layout

Section: Food Hotkeys

  hud-food-slot : Integer -> Integer
  hud-food-slot (hotbar) =
    if hotbar < 1 then -1
    else if hotbar > 3 then -1
    else hotbar - 1

Section: Layout

 Offsets in HUD pixels from the bottom centre of the screen. The stamina bar's
 lower edge sits at 130.

  hud-row-y : Integer -> Integer
  hud-row-y (row) = if row == 0 then 110 else 62

  hud-food-x : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  hud-food-x (slot) (count) = slot * 50 - (count - 1) * 25
